### Analysis

The problem stems from the way the year is extracted from the input string. The input uses a two-digit format for the year, which was being parsed as an ancient year instead of the appropriate four-digit year (e.g., 19 was parsed as 19 AD instead of 2019). By adjusting the parsing to interpret the two-digit year as part of the 21st century, we ensure the correct date is set, making the position valid.

